{ Which bishop would Black most like to improve? Which trade reduces the attack? Name the structure and one resource for the other side. ANSWER: The d5-e6-f5 chain gives Black space and restrains e4, but it leaves e5 as a potential white outpost and limits the c8 bishop. Challenge the good dark-squared bishop where possible. Maneuver a knight toward e5 only when the exchange consequences are favorable. Use patient piece improvement. Black: Black seeks ...Ne4 and attacking chances near your king. Do not create targets with unnecessary kingside pawn moves. } *

