{ Find the forcing move. Why is capturing a bishop or promoting to a queen not the whole calculation? ANSWER: exf2+. The forcing sequence uses the passed pawn, knight underpromotion with check, and the exposed white king to win material. This is why the course avoids the early e3 trap. } *

